Subject: [PATCH] Control login: name-only allowlist, forced password reset,
 Home link.

Sign-in takes an allowlisted operator name, prompts for a new password when
password_set is false, drops forgot-password in favor of amey/admin emails,
and adds a Home back link on the control panel. operator-auth claim + status
stay in sync with the Supabase edge function.
